# Disket Mono (Mariano Diez / Rostype): its EULA forbids redistributing the
# font, so the files are never committed. Drop DisketMono-Regular.ttf,
# DisketMono-Bold.ttf and Disket-mono_EULA.pdf here for local builds.
public/fonts/disket-mono/*
!public/fonts/disket-mono/README.md
